# PageDesk toolbar icons, 16x16, hand drawn (docs/PAGEDESK-SPEC.md 11.6, 17.6).
# '#' black ink, 'o' white (mask only, the white underlay), '.' transparent.
# The optional `vga` block under an icon is the 4bpp colour variant: one hex digit a
# pixel (the 16-colour VGA palette), '.' transparent.  Mono adapters never read it.
# tools/os88pdart.py converts this file; the grids ARE the source.

